B.Io=new A.kZ("Do I need public speaking experience?","No. We welcome people who are just starting. You do not need to feel confident before you join \u2014 the community is how confidence grows.")
B.Il=new A.kZ("What if I'm extremely nervous?","Then you're in the right place. Nervousness is common here. We normalize it, understand it, and practice speaking through it \u2014 together.")
B.Im=new A.kZ("Do I have to speak during my first session?","We'll explain what a typical session looks like when you reach out, and you can start at a pace that feels manageable. There is no pressure to perform.")
B.In=new A.kZ("Who can join?","Anyone who wants a supportive space to practice speaking. If you are not sure whether it is a fit, email us and we will help you decide.")
B.Ij=new A.kZ("What happens during a typical session?","Sessions focus on practice, reflection, and constructive feedback in a supportive environment. We will walk you through the flow before you join.")
B.Ik=new A.kZ("Can I talk to you before joining a session?","Yes. We offer a free online explanation session so you can talk with a host, understand what we do, and ask questions. There is no speaking required and no pressure to join.")
B.Ng=s([B.Io,B.Il,B.Im,B.In,B.Ij,B.Ik],A.an("y<kZ>"))
